# Nuxt 4 컨벤션

참고: https://nuxt.com/docs/4.x/getting-started/introduction

## 구조

- `app/pages/` — 라우팅
- `app/components/` — 컴포넌트 (auto-import, `Dd` prefix UI)
- `app/composables/`, `app/stores/` — auto-import
- `server/api/` — Nitro API
- `i18n/locales/*.json` — i18n (ko/en 동시 반영)

## 원칙

- `<script setup lang="ts">` + Composition API
- Nuxt composable auto-import (`useFetch`, `useI18n`, `useHead`)
- SSR: `.client.vue` suffix, `import.meta.client` 구분
- 패키지 매니저: **bun**
- Vercel analytics: `@vercel/*/vue` import (nuxt/runtime 금지 — node-server preview 이슈)
- SEO·AEO: `.cursor/rules/seo-nuxt.mdc` 및 `/seo-*` 커맨드 참고
